OL,3,GNEWSAJLS set for summer show in city
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FJLS are among the performers at a new
OL,7,Fseries of outdoor music events due to
OL,8,Ftake place in Leicester next summer.
OL,10,FThe events, branded Leicester Live will
OL,11,Ftake place in Abbey Park in August.
OL,13,FPromotor Supermodified said the series
OL,14,Fwill bring "major live music
OL,15,Fperformances to one of the city's most
OL,16,Fhistoric and picturesque locations".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
