OL,3,GNEWSAJLS set for summer show in city
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy band are due to perform on 19
OL,7,FAugust, alongside Pixie Lott and The
OL,8,FWanted 2.0 before Ministry of Sound
OL,9,FClassical take to the stage on 21
OL,10,FAugust along with Paul Oakenfold, Angie
OL,11,FBrown and King Brasstards.
